  "notes": "Heilongjiang Beidahuang Agriculture Co Ltd (SSE: 600598) \u2014 listed subsidiary of state-owned Beidahuang Agricultural Reclamation Group. Operates ~12.96 million mu (~865,000 hectares \u2248 2,135K acres) of state-leased cultivated land in Heilongjiang's Sanjiang Plain (one of the world's three black-soil belts). Primary revenue stream is land-contracting fees (subleasing state farmland to cooperative farmers) plus rice, corn, soybean trading. Reports CNY-millions PRC GAAP. Lists in CNY on Shanghai Stock Exchange. Listed since March 2002. Historically very low debt \u2014 pure land-rental operating model with minimal capex. FY2020 detailed data not consistently available across English aggregators, so the 5-year history begins in FY2021. acresK figure (~2,135) reflects total operated/contracted area, not freehold ownership.",
